{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得到了学园长的许可，也获得了一笔资金。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且也按照计划顺利借到了烘培的场所！”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天的休息时间，我跟安洁两人独占了料理实习室。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了休业式，终于要开始动手准备了。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然花了一整天交涉，不过能顺利借到真是太好了。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了对了。放学后料理研的各位同学也会来呢。”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，今天我们只是借用一张桌子的感觉。”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，第二学期的特别课程全部结束了，这间教室之后就不会用来上课。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "照往常的情况是料理研究会的学生们独占使用，而这次我们提出了借用的要求。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为休业式的前一天无论如何都想借用一整天。所以一开始还是和大家打好关系。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是主人，非常擅长用话语让女性听从呢……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，那个说法有点……”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为被主人说了甜言蜜语后，安洁立刻就神魂颠倒了喔！”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是因为是安洁吧。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，希望您那些甜言蜜语都只对安洁说。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她笑嘻嘻地说。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她这么开朗大方地戏弄，我不只不生气反而还很开心。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这层意义上来说，安洁比我擅长多了。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算是甜言蜜语，也只是‘安洁今天也好可爱’、‘喜欢你’之类这种程度的话而已。”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为主人每天都说，所以安洁承受不了了。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说、现在也……那个、那个、主人……”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……安洁，过来。”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到安洁的眼睛一下子变得水汪汪，我立刻招手让她到身边来。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……啾、嗯呼……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随着拥抱，我轻轻吻住她诱人的唇。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……主人。”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“反正现在只有我们两人……”", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯嗯……主人，安洁的主人。喜欢喜欢喜欢～好喜欢您……”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁已经忍不住的感觉，她也伸手抱住我，用身体磨蹭。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果能让她这么高兴，我倒是想每天都说。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……立刻就陶醉的安洁也好可爱，我最喜欢你了。”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错，现在就是这样。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊……！”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她颤抖着发出呻吟，然后满脸通红地对我害羞一笑。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人。”", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以把头借给安洁一下吗？”", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁弯身靠向我。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯♪”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她把我的头抱在胸口。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人、主人……是胸部喔～”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈……有点难受，安洁。”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然比起难受更觉得舒服。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脸埋在安洁柔软的乳沟，每次呼吸都有安洁的香味……", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“主人喜欢的……”", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请尽情享受……面对安洁的时候，请随您喜欢……”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那……我要磨蹭了喔。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是……”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "喜悦到达顶点，而我也感到快乐，所以就更高兴了。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我的“松懈”就是安洁最大的喜悦，所以我也毫不客气地尽情享受。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然每次都是如此，不过这是我们两人之间一种良好的循环。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好软……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯、嗯呼、嗯……”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为在学校里通常没办法两人独处，所以我们现在尽情地享受。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到身体终于分开，我们对彼此害臊地笑了笑。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿……差不多来开始吧？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，那首先要做什么？”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“确定配方，然后做出试吃品来检讨。主人，就请您试吃看看啰♪”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“──所以，安洁首先做出了几种。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，安洁立刻照中午拟定的配方烤了几个试吃蛋糕。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的眼前摆放了５种蛋糕，刚出炉还热腾腾的。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“都要感谢资金充足，所以才能做试吃品呢，啊哈哈。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“的确……如果学园长不同意的话还不知道该怎么办。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天去拜托的时候学园长很爽快就许可，而且还帮我们想到了后续的细节。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还差得远呢。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“得到了这么大的帮助，我们一定要为休业式做出美味的蛋糕才行呢，安洁。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的，这也是报恩的一环呢！”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么……首先就请您试吃吧主人。安洁来切蛋糕喔！”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "带着笑容同意我的话，安洁指了指蛋糕。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要从哪一种开始呢？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯～每一种看起来都很好吃……”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说你真的很会做蛋糕呢，安洁。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我眼前的蛋糕每一个都像专业的糕点师做的一样美丽。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然知道她本来就擅长料理，不过水准高到这种程度我还是很惊讶。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁可以算是全能女仆呢，全部都多亏了母亲的教导。”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“母亲说过学得越多就能得到越多快乐。现在安洁很明白其中的道理了，呵呵呵。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，这样啊。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是啊哈哈的时候吧瓜生君！”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0062", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，一句吐槽插了进来。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，抱歉吵到你们了。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如同刚才说的，放学后我们只借了一张桌子而已，所以其他桌子旁边还有料理研的同学。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的很谢谢你。班上同学有料理研的社员太好了。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "多亏了这女孩的帮忙，让我们顺利就借到了一块位置。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“别管那个了，快点吃啦，真是的！安洁的蛋糕很让人在意欸！”", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0063", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是蛋糕是蛋糕～”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员A", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "ra0000", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有这么多……安洁的主人好好喔。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员B", "alt_speaker_idx": 291, "voice": "rb0000", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的其他人都聚集到了我们的桌子旁。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“正是如此，主人。不只是外表，也要试看看味道才行。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉抱歉，说的也是……那我就从旁边这块开始吃了。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不对不对，第一块应该选草莓蛋糕吧。”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0064", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～反而是收尾才对吧？”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员A", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "ra0001", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想吃巧克力的……”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员B", "alt_speaker_idx": 291, "voice": "rb0001", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聚集过来的同学们都对安洁的蛋糕很感兴趣，讨论得很热烈。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实她们从刚才开始就一脸期待了。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊啊，那么。”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，机会难得，让大家也帮忙试吃吧？”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说得也是呢。毕竟安洁烤了这么多。”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“各位，如果不嫌弃的话，请跟安洁的主人一起试吃吧！”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？我们也可以吃吗！？太好了！”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0065", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "料理研的大家都非常兴奋。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟安洁对看了一眼。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那安洁就立刻照人数切啰～♪”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“耶耶♪”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员A", "alt_speaker_idx": 290, "voice": "ra0002", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "料理研究部員Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没想到这么Lucky～”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "料理研究社社员B", "alt_speaker_idx": 291, "voice": "rb0002", "char_id": "料理研究部員Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过瓜生君，这些蛋糕是为了什么的试吃呢？和安洁的圣诞节吗？”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0066", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我之前没有说明到这部份吗？”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 294, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“其实，主人和安洁要为休业式准备一个大蛋糕。”", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大到足够分给学校的每个人喔！”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 274, "voice": "ag2605", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？真的吗！？好厉害！”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 304, "voice": "ja0067", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家听了又更兴奋了。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
